# Exemptions for scripts/audit-private-default-branches.sh
#
# One commit per line, four fields separated by whitespace, the reason last:
#
#   <org>/<repo>  <full 40-character sha>  <date measured, YYYY-MM-DD>  <reason>
#
# Each entry names exactly one commit in exactly one repository. There are no
# patterns, no repository-wide entries and no abbreviated SHAs: the script
# refuses a line that is not in this shape, so an entry is a ceiling on what it
# covers rather than a licence for whatever comes next. A new direct push is
# not on this list and still fails the audit.
#
# An entry stops matching once its commit is older than the audit window; the
# run then prints a notice naming it, and it can be removed in a later pull
# request.

simtabi/cli-kit-js          99686de71da67cfd36db125a8f344b5c1610f176  2026-11-02  Owner-approved one-time creation of main on an empty repository during the 2026-11-01 branch sweep.
